WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.216 --> 00:00:14.963
Tina: We have to hide you quickly.

2
00:00:14.983 --> 00:00:17.944
Bello: I hope your neighbor didn't hurt herself.

3
00:00:17.964 --> 00:00:20.466
Tina: She's always spying.

4
00:00:21.106 --> 00:00:22.227
I'm sure she's okay.

5
00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:24.068
Bello: I'll go check.

6
00:00:41.376 --> 00:00:43.417
Mrs. Rice: Oh, no, my little pooch!

7
00:00:43.477 --> 00:00:44.257
What's wrong?

8
00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.417
Bello: Is everything okay, Mrs.

9
00:00:46.477 --> 00:00:47.358
Rice? Mrs.

10
00:00:47.398 --> 00:00:50.098
Rice: It's a giant!

11
00:00:50.118 --> 00:00:55.200
Aaah! Bello: I guess I stand out.

12
00:00:55.220 --> 00:00:57.720
Tina: We should get you out of sight.

13
00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:00.521
Bello: I don't like scaring people.

14
00:01:00.541 --> 00:01:02.642
Tina: You can't help it.

15
00:01:03.382 --> 00:01:04.622
You're a giant!

16
00:01:05.082 --> 00:01:07.503
Bello: I think you're right.

17
00:01:08.203 --> 00:01:08.903
I should hide.

18
00:01:08.923 --> 00:01:12.736
Tina: Let's use the backdoor.

19
00:01:12.876 --> 00:01:13.476
I have a key.

20
00:01:13.496 --> 00:01:15.277
Bello: Good idea.

21
00:01:15.297 --> 00:01:17.678
Tina: I'll see if anyone is home.

22
00:01:17.698 --> 00:01:23.500
Bello: I'll hide here.

23
00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:27.702
Tina: Hello!

24
00:01:28.642 --> 00:01:29.623
Is anyone home?

25
00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:31.123
It's me!

26
00:01:31.183 --> 00:01:33.384
Bello: Is it safe?

27
00:01:33.404 --> 00:01:35.705
Tina: I think so.

28
00:01:35.985 --> 00:01:36.686
Come inside!

29
00:01:44.318 --> 00:01:49.062
Bello: Do you have another idea?

30
00:01:49.082 --> 00:01:53.465
Tina: Maybe if you curl up really small, you will fit.

31
00:01:53.485 --> 00:01:56.188
Bello: I'm too big to be small.

32
00:01:56.208 --> 00:01:59.471
Tina: If only we had something to shrink you with!

33
00:02:01.612 --> 00:02:04.935
Bello: Do you have shrinking machines in your world?

34
00:02:04.955 --> 00:02:06.196
Tina: No.

35
00:02:06.456 --> 00:02:07.617
I was just wishing.

36
00:02:07.637 --> 00:02:10.340
Bello: We have to do something.

37
00:02:11.316 --> 00:02:16.578
Bello: If I scare everyone who sees me, I won't be able [n3@to help Danny very easily.

38
00:02:16.598 --> 00:02:20.900
Tina: You can hide in the garage.

39
00:02:21.781 --> 00:02:23.962
I can open the garage door from inside.

40
00:02:23.982 --> 00:02:26.183
Bello: Sounds great.

41
00:02:35.287 --> 00:02:36.727
Go around to the big door.

42
00:02:37.368 --> 00:02:37.988
It's opening.

43
00:02:44.108 --> 00:02:46.149
Bello: This is as small as my closet.

44
00:02:46.169 --> 00:02:47.770
Tina: I'm sorry.

45
00:02:48.090 --> 00:02:49.951
It's the best I can do for now.

46
00:02:50.692 --> 00:02:52.092
Bello: Ow.

47
00:02:52.973 --> 00:02:55.815
Oops! Tina: Are you all right?

48
00:02:55.835 --> 00:02:57.636
Bello: I'm okay.

49
00:02:58.016 --> 00:02:59.577
I hope I didn't break anything.

50
00:02:59.597 --> 00:03:01.338
Tina: Don't worry about it.

51
00:03:01.978 --> 00:03:03.559
I'm sure the wagon is fine.

52
00:03:03.579 --> 00:03:05.820
Tina: It's not broken.

53
00:03:06.401 --> 00:03:07.721
It rolled onto these sheets.

54
00:03:07.741 --> 00:03:12.264
Bello: This isn't as much fun as the last time I came to your world.

55
00:03:13.584 --> 00:03:15.766
Tina: Hey, that gives me an idea.

56
00:03:16.907 --> 00:03:22.713
Mrs. Rice: Are you okay, my little pooch?

57
00:03:24.574 --> 00:03:25.956
Yes, I saw it too.

58
00:03:25.976 --> 00:03:28.798
Mrs. Rice: It was a giant monster!

59
00:03:28.818 --> 00:03:31.020
I have to warn the city.

60
00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:32.982
Mrs. Rice: Hello?

61
00:03:33.463 --> 00:03:35.144
Is this the emergency service?

62
00:03:36.285 --> 00:03:38.167
You have to send the army!
